# A tab-separated table's last column is data. `baseline/technique-sources.tsv`
# puts `note` last, and 1523 of its 1524 rows carry none, so every one of them
# ends in a tab -- the separator the format requires, not whitespace anyone
# left behind. `git diff --check` is one of this repository's gates and reads
# that tab as damage, which would refuse every future change to the table for a
# character it cannot be written without.
#
# Scoped to the one file that has this shape. The other six tables under
# `baseline/` end no row in a tab and are held to the ordinary rule.
baseline/technique-sources.tsv -whitespace
